    "identifier": "tsuchigumo-spider-art-web-bind",
    "description": "<p>You knead sticky webbing in your mouth and spit it out covering the target area in front of you. Creatures in the target area must make a Dexterity saving throw, being Restrained and being unable to make opportunity attacks, on a failed save as the sticky web restricts movement until the end of the affected creatures next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the size of the cone by 5 feet.</p>",
